			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">The common software component or software wrapper that is plain - internal behavior can be explained with simple overview description. Interface definition and allocated requirements are sufficient to develop and verify the implementation.</_text>
