			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">The software component uses or implements the software data structures in RAM or ROM, for example: FIFO, LIFO, GRAPH, LIST, HASH function, TREES, state machine</_text>
